# PBL6 E-Commerce Backend - Long Term Memory

## Project Overview
- **Project Name**: PBL6 E-Commerce Backend
- **Type**: REST API Backend for E-commerce Platform
- **Tech Stack**: Node.js, Express.js, Prisma ORM, MySQL
- **Port**: 3000
- **Main Branch**: main
- **Dev Branch**: dev

## Core Features
1. **Authentication & Authorization**
   - Admin authentication (JWT, 1h expiration)
   - Customer authentication (JWT, 24h expiration)
   - Token verification via Authorization header (Bearer scheme)
   - Social login support (Google, Facebook via IDs)
   - Role-based access control (admin/customer)
   - Middleware: auth.middleware.js (checkLogin)

2. **Product Management**
   - CRUD operations for products with role-based data visibility
   - Unified pagination with advanced filtering (name, category, price range, tags)
   - Sorting support (by any product field)
   - Product images (up to 5 images per product) with cascade delete
   - Categories management
   - Tags system (many-to-many relationship)
   - Transaction-based delete for data integrity
   - Product attributes: price, sale_price, stock_quantity, dimensions (weight, length, width, height), material, color, brand, style, rating, reviews, warranty, shipping info

3. **Order Management**
   - Order creation with multiple products
   - Order tracking by customer
   - Order status: pending, confirmed, shipping, completed, cancelled
   - Payment methods: cash_on_delivery, bank_transfer, credit_card, e_wallet, installment
   - Payment status: pending, paid, failed, refunded
   - Shipping methods: standard_delivery, express_delivery, same_day_delivery, pickup_at_store, installation_service
   - Sepay transaction tracking: transaction_id, transaction_code, gateway, paid_amount
   - Payment verification timestamp tracking

4. **Payment Integration**
   - VNPay QR payment
   - Sepay webhook integration for payment notifications
   - Payment verification with detailed logging
   - Transaction tracking (ID, code, content, gateway, amount)
   - Webhook endpoint with comprehensive request logging

5. **Shipping Integration**
   - GHN (Giao Hàng Nhanh) API integration
   - Get provinces, districts, wards
   - Calculate shipping fee
   - Get available shipping services

6. **Image Management**
   - Local storage with Multer (public/uploads/)
   - Cloudinary integration for cloud storage
   - Image URL formatting utility
   - Cascade delete support (images auto-deleted with product)

7. **AI Integration**
   - Google Generative AI (@google/generative-ai)
   - OpenAI

