## Database Schema (Prisma)
- **User Tables**: Customer, Admin
- **Product Tables**: Product, Product_Image (with cascade delete), Category, Tag
- **Order Tables**: Order (with Sepay fields), OrderDetail
- **Enums**: Order_Status, Payment_Method, Payment_Status, Shipping_Method, Product_Status
- **Indexes**: transaction_id, payment_status, order_number (for fast lookups)
- **Binary Targets**: native, debian-openssl-3.0.x (for deployment compatibility)

### Order Model Sepay Integration
- `transaction_id` (unique) - Sepay transaction identifier
- `transaction_code` - Bank transaction code (e.g., FT25322218005287)
- `transaction_content` - Full transfer content from bank
- `gateway` - Payment gateway/bank name (MBBank, Momo, VNPay, etc.)
- `paid_amount` - Actual amount received from payment
- `payment_verified_at` - Timestamp when webhook confirmed payment

## API Endpoints Structure
- `/api/auth/*` - Authentication endpoints
- `/api/users/*` - User management
- `/api/products/*` - Product operations
- `/api/orders/*` - Order management
- `/api/payment/*` - Payment & shipping operations

