## Important Notes
- Images stored locally in `public/uploads/` with subfolders (user, product)
- Cloudinary used for cloud image storage
- Product images use cascade delete - deleting product auto-deletes images
- Delete operations wrapped in transactions for data integrity
- Error handling via centralized errorHandling.middleware
- Response formatting via utils/response.js (successResponse, errorResponse)
- Custom ApiError class for consistent error handling
- File size guideline: Keep files under 150 lines
- Database: MySQL with Prisma ORM
- Prisma client output: ./src/generated/client
- Token verification uses Authorization header (Bearer scheme)
- Webhook logging enabled for payment debugging
- Role-based data filtering (admin sees more details than customer)

